2
00:04:35,350 --> 00:04:39,900
MUSIC GARDEN TAKANE LUI Birthday Live 2025!

3
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:48,800
はい 尾丸ポルカでーす よろしくお願いいたします
Hi, I'm Omaru Polka. Pleased to be here!

4
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,500
こんばんは 司会の白上フブキです よろしくお願いいたします
Good evening! I'm your host, Shirakami Fubuki! Nice to meet you all!

5
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,500
さて 今夜も始まりました MUSIC GARDENでございますけども
Now, tonight marks another edition of MUSIC GARDEN...

6
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:58,200
なんか久々だね
It's been a while, hasn't it?

7
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,900
はい 約２年ぶりに復活...
Yes, making a comeback after about two years...

8
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,808
というわけでですね、
And so,

9
00:05:01,808 --> 00:05:03,508
あ、復活。おめでたいね。
Oh, the revival! Congratulations!

10
00:05:03,508 --> 00:05:05,008
そうですね。
Yes, indeed.

11
00:05:05,008 --> 00:05:06,008
髪切った？
Did you cut your hair?

12
00:05:06,008 --> 00:05:09,008
あ、切ってないんですけど。ルイ姉様もそんなこと言ってましたね。
Ah, I didn't. But Lui-nesama was saying that too!

13
00:05:09,008 --> 00:05:10,508
そうだっけ？
Did she really?

14
00:05:10,508 --> 00:05:13,508
そうですよ！ポルカさんもお変わりなく...
Yes, she did! And you haven't changed either, Polka-san...

15
00:05:13,808 --> 00:05:16,508
まあ、はい。元気でやってるわ。
Well, yes. I'm doing great.

16
00:05:16,508 --> 00:05:22,508
それはよかったです。ポルカさんの元気にも負けないくらい、今回元気なゲストさんもいますので。
That's good to hear. We have some very energetic guests today who won't lose to your energy!

17
00:05:22,508 --> 00:05:24,508
うん、それは楽しみだね。
Yeah, I'm looking forward to that.

18
00:05:25,008 --> 00:05:29,008
はい。では早速紹介していきましょう。本日のゲストの登場です！
Alright, let's introduce them right away. Here come today's guests!

19
00:05:36,008 --> 00:05:38,508
音乃瀬奏！
Otonose Kanade!

20
00:05:53,008 --> 00:05:56,008
猫又おかゆ！
Nekomata Okayu!

21
00:06:08,508 --> 00:06:11,008
大神ミオ！
Ookami Mio!

22
00:06:25,508 --> 00:06:28,508
百鬼あやめ！
Nakiri Ayame!

23
00:06:43,008 --> 00:06:46,008
鷹嶺ルイ！
Takane Lui!

24
00:06:56,008 --> 00:07:01,008
今夜も豪華ゲストでお送りするミュージックガーデン。なんと今夜は、
Tonight's Music Garden features a gorgeous guest lineup! And tonight...

25
00:07:01,008 --> 00:07:06,008
あっと驚くような仕掛けいっぱいでお送りするみたいですよ。最後まで見逃せません！
...it seems we have lots of surprising gimmicks in store. Don't miss it till the very end!

26
00:07:06,508 --> 00:07:11,508
ああー、どんな仕掛けなんだろうね。鷹嶺ルイくん。
Oh, I wonder what kind of gimmicks those are. Takane Lui-kun?

27
00:07:11,508 --> 00:07:12,508
はい。
Yes?

28
00:07:12,508 --> 00:07:17,508
ミュージックガーデンと言えば鷹嶺ルイくんだから。今日は誕生日ということで。
Speaking of Music Garden, it has to be you. And since today is your birthday...

29
00:07:17,508 --> 00:07:20,508
はい、ありがとうございます。そうなんです、今日誕生日なんですよ。
Yes, thank you! That's right, today is my birthday!

30
00:07:21,008 --> 00:07:26,508
２年ぶりに復活したけど、どう？緊張してる？
We're back after two years! How are you feeling? Nervous?

31
00:07:26,508 --> 00:07:32,508
はい、緊張してます。でも復活にふさわしい場にできるんじゃないかなと思っているので、楽しみにしていてください。
Yes, I'm nervous. But I think I can make this stage worthy of the revival, so please look forward to it!

32
00:07:33,508 --> 00:07:35,508
なんか匂いますね。
I smell something...

33
00:07:36,008 --> 00:07:38,008
え？ちゃんとお風呂入ってきた？
Eh? Did you take a proper bath?

34
00:07:38,508 --> 00:07:42,508
その匂いじゃないです！それじゃないですよ。
Not that kind of smell! That's not what I meant!

35
00:07:42,508 --> 00:07:43,508
あ、そっかそっか。
Ah, right, right.

36
00:07:43,808 --> 00:07:46,008
今日は一曲目の披露だよね？
Today you'll perform your first song, right?

37
00:07:46,208 --> 00:07:48,508
はい、このあとすぐに披露させていただきます。
Yes, I'll be performing it right after this.

38
00:07:49,008 --> 00:07:55,508
はい、一曲目は鷹嶺ルイさんに、アニメの主題歌でも話題でした「BOW AND ARROW」を披露していただきます。
Alright! For the first song, Takane Lui-san will perform "BOW AND ARROW", which became a hot topic as an anime theme song!

39
00:07:56,008 --> 00:07:58,508
ほう。あのフィギュアスケートの？
Oh, the one associated with figure skating?

40
00:07:58,508 --> 00:08:06,508
はい。今回は特別にフィギュアスケート風のダンスを踊ってくださるダンサーさんと一緒にパフォーマンスをさせていただきます。
Yes. This time, I will perform with a dancer who will specially perform a figure skating-style dance!

41
00:08:07,008 --> 00:08:09,508
ほう、それは楽しみだな。
Oh, I look forward to that.

42
00:08:09,508 --> 00:08:13,008
そうですね。それではスタンバイの方よろしくお願いします。
Indeed. Well then, please get on standby.

43
00:08:13,008 --> 00:08:15,008
はい、よろしくお願いします。
Yes, thank you.

44
00:08:18,008 --> 00:08:22,508
ねえ、あれ猫又くんと音乃瀬くんと大神くん、あ、初登場だっけ？
Hey, are Nekomata-kun, Otonose-kun, and Ookami-kun making their first appearance?

45
00:08:24,008 --> 00:08:26,508
そうですよ！
That's right!

46
00:08:27,508 --> 00:08:30,008
音乃瀬くん、緊張してるんじゃない？
Otonose-kun, aren't you nervous?

47
00:08:30,208 --> 00:08:34,008
もう、全然大丈夫ですよ！いけます！
I'm completely fine! I can do this!

48
00:08:34,508 --> 00:08:38,008
元気だね。
So energetic!

49
00:08:38,008 --> 00:08:40,008
元気ですね。
She's so lively.

50
00:08:40,008 --> 00:08:42,508
そして二回目の登場が百鬼くん。
And making her second appearance is Nakiri-kun.

51
00:08:42,508 --> 00:08:44,508
はい、お久しぶりです！
Yes, it's been a while!

52
00:08:44,508 --> 00:08:45,508
そういえば、シュークリーム食べた？
By the way, did you eat cream puffs?

53
00:08:45,808 --> 00:08:48,508
え、ちょっと今日、まだ... まだ今日食べてないんです。
Eh? Actually, today, I... I hasn't eaten them yet today.

54
00:08:49,008 --> 00:08:54,008
あ、そっかそっか。まあ後でね、ゆっくりね、食べてね。
Ah, I see, I see. Well, you can eat them slowly later.

55
00:08:54,008 --> 00:08:55,808
はい、いっぱい食べます！
Yes, I'll eat a lot of them!

56
00:08:56,008 --> 00:09:00,008
のちほど皆様ともゆっくりお話しさせていただこうと思います。
We'll have a chance to chat slowly with everyone later.

57
00:09:00,008 --> 00:09:03,008
さて、スタンバイができたみたいですね。
Now, it looks like she is on standby.

58
00:09:03,008 --> 00:09:05,508
アニメをリスペクトしたダンスにもご注目ください。
Please pay attention to the dance that respects the anime.

59
00:09:05,808 --> 00:09:09,508
鷹嶺ルイで、「BOW AND ARROW」。
Here is Takane Lui with "BOW AND ARROW"!

60
00:09:33,208 --> 00:09:38,208
気づけば靴は汚れ 錆びついた諸刃を伝う雨
Before I knew it, my shoes were soiled, and rain dripped down the rusted double-edged blade.

61
00:09:38,508 --> 00:09:43,708
憧れはそのままで 夢から目覚めた先には夢
With my yearnings left as they are, waking up from a dream only led to another dream.

62
00:09:44,008 --> 00:09:49,208
聞こえたその泣き声 消え入る手前のノブレスオブリージュ
I heard that crying voice, a noblesse oblige right on the verge of fading away.

63
00:09:49,508 --> 00:09:54,508
憧れのその先へ うずくまる君を見つける為
Beyond that yearning, in order to find you crouching there.

64
00:09:54,808 --> 00:10:00,008
行け 行け 追いつけない速度で 飛べ インパルス加速して
Go, go, at an unreachable speed; fly, accelerating your impulses.

65
00:10:00,016 --> 00:10:00,816
インパルス加速して
...accelerating my impulses

66
00:10:00,816 --> 00:10:03,216
行け きっとこの時を感じる為に
Go, surely to feel this very moment

67
00:10:03,216 --> 00:10:05,816
生まれてきたんだ
I was born into this world

68
00:10:05,816 --> 00:10:08,416
未来を掴んで 期待値を超えて
Seizing the future, exceeding all expectations

69
00:10:08,416 --> 00:10:10,916
額に吹き刺す風
With the wind blowing against my forehead

70
00:10:10,916 --> 00:10:13,516
今に見よきっと君の眩しさに
Just wait and see, surely at your radiance

71
00:10:13,516 --> 00:10:16,016
誰もが気づくだろう
everyone will soon take notice

72
00:10:16,016 --> 00:10:19,016
相応しい声で 視線追い越して
With a fitting voice, overtaking all glances

73
00:10:19,016 --> 00:10:21,816
虚空を超えて行け
Go beyond the empty void

74
00:10:21,816 --> 00:10:24,816
見違えていく君の指から今
Right now, from your fingers that look so different

75
00:10:24,816 --> 00:10:27,716
手を放す
I let go of your hand

76
00:10:37,316 --> 00:10:40,016
気づけば謎は解かれ
Before I knew it, the mystery was solved

77
00:10:40,016 --> 00:10:42,516
木目ごと見慣れた板の上
On top of these familiar wooden stage planks

78
00:10:42,516 --> 00:10:45,016
あの頃焦がれたような
Have I managed to become

79
00:10:45,016 --> 00:10:47,816
大人になれたかな
The kind of adult I longed to be back then?

80
00:10:47,816 --> 00:10:50,416
そう君の苦悩は
Yes, your suffering

81
00:10:50,416 --> 00:10:53,016
君が自分で選んだ痛みだ
Is a pain you chose for yourself

82
00:10:53,016 --> 00:10:55,616
そして掴んだあの煌めきも
And that sparkle you grasped

83
00:10:55,616 --> 00:10:58,216
全て君のものだ
Is entirely yours

84
00:10:58,216 --> 00:11:01,016
僕は弓になって
I became a bow

85
00:11:01,016 --> 00:11:04,216
君の白んだ掌をとって強く引いた
Taking your pale hand and pulling back with all my might

86
00:11:04,216 --> 00:11:07,016
今君は決して
Now, you have become an arrow

87
00:11:07,016 --> 00:11:09,916
風に流れない矢になって
That will never be swept away by the wind

88
00:11:09,916 --> 00:11:13,016
行け 行け 決して振り向かないで
Go, go, never look back

89
00:11:13,016 --> 00:11:15,816
飛べ もう届かない場所へ
Fly, to a place far beyond reach

90
00:11:15,816 --> 00:11:18,516
行け 行け 君はいつだって
Go, go, you were always

91
00:11:18,516 --> 00:11:21,016
輝いていた
Shining so brightly

92
00:11:30,816 --> 00:11:33,416
未来を掴んで 期待値を超えて
Seizing the future, exceeding all expectations

93
00:11:33,416 --> 00:11:36,016
額に吹き刺す風
With the wind blowing against my forehead

94
00:11:36,016 --> 00:11:38,516
今に見よきっと君の眩しさに
Just wait and see, surely at your radiance

95
00:11:38,516 --> 00:11:41,016
誰もが気づくだろう
everyone will soon take notice

96
00:11:41,016 --> 00:11:44,016
相応しい声で 視線追い越して
With a fitting voice, overtaking all glances

97
00:11:44,016 --> 00:11:46,816
虚空を超えて行け
Go beyond the empty void

98
00:11:46,816 --> 00:11:49,816
見違えていく君の指から今
Right now, from your fingers that look so different

99
00:11:49,816 --> 00:11:52,716
手を放す
I let go of your hand

100
00:12:11,016 --> 00:12:13,516
はい、続いてはねこたかです。
Alright, next up is Nekotaka.

101
00:12:13,516 --> 00:12:15,816
よろしくお願いいします。
We look forward to working with you.

102
00:12:15,816 --> 00:12:17,616
お二人はどういう関係なの？
What kind of relationship do you two have?

103
00:12:17,616 --> 00:12:19,416
パーティ仲間です。
We're party buddies.

104
00:12:19,416 --> 00:12:21,216
パーティ？！
Party?!

105
00:12:21,216 --> 00:12:24,416
よくルイの家で勝手にパーティ開催してます。
We often host parties at Lui's house without asking.

106
00:12:24,416 --> 00:12:25,816
勝手に？！
Without asking?!

107
00:12:25,816 --> 00:12:30,516
人のお家で勝手にパーティはしないと思うんですけども。
Normally, you wouldn't host a party at someone's house without asking...

108
00:12:30,516 --> 00:12:32,416
いやいや、そうなんですけど。
No, no, that's true, but...

109
00:12:32,416 --> 00:12:36,516
最初私もすごい驚いたんですが、最近ではもう私から
At first, I was really surprised too, but lately I've been...

110
00:12:36,516 --> 00:12:40,516
「次いつパーティ？」って言うくらいには虜になっちゃってますね。
asking, "When's the next party?" I've completely fallen for it.

111
00:12:43,016 --> 00:12:45,516
これはねこまたくんの策略かな？
Is this Nekomata-kun's strategy?

112
00:12:45,516 --> 00:12:48,016
こうなると思ってました。
I knew it would turn out like this.

113
00:12:48,016 --> 00:12:51,016
フブさんも今度どうですか、パーティ？
Fubu-san, how about you join us next time for a party?

114
00:12:51,016 --> 00:12:54,616
パーティっていうのは...私も行っていいのかな？
A party...? Is it okay if I go too?

115
00:12:54,616 --> 00:12:56,516
ぜひぜひ！
By all means!

116
00:12:56,516 --> 00:12:59,016
あ、やっぱりねこまたくんが許可下ろすんだね。
Ah, so Nekomata-kun is the one who gives permission.

117
00:12:59,016 --> 00:13:01,016
楽しそうですね。
It sounds like fun.

118
00:13:01,016 --> 00:13:03,516
ポルさんもぜひ！
Pol-san, you too!

119
00:13:03,516 --> 00:13:08,016
あ、じゃ、この後あたりにでも行きましょうか、ポルさんね！
Oh, then shall we go after this, Pol-san?

120
00:13:08,016 --> 00:13:11,016
お、俺？鷹嶺くんが苦笑いしてるんだけど。
Me? Takane-kun is dryly laughing here...

121
00:13:11,016 --> 00:13:14,016
なんか勝手に決められちゃいました。
Somehow, they just decided it without me.

122
00:13:14,016 --> 00:13:19,016
そんなお二人にはですね、かっこよさが詰まったダークチックな曲を披露していただきます！
For the two of you, we will have you perform a cool, dark-themed song!

123
00:13:19,016 --> 00:13:20,516
闇堕ちしてるじゃないか！
You guys have fallen to the dark side!

124
00:13:20,516 --> 00:13:22,516
そうなんですよ。
That's right.

125
00:13:22,516 --> 00:13:29,016
でもねこたかならではの低音を活かしたかっこいいパフォーマンスをしますので、楽しみに！
But we'll put on a cool performance making the most of Nekotaka's deep vocals, so look forward to it!

126
00:13:29,016 --> 00:13:33,016
はい！それではスタンバイ、おねがいします！
Alright! Please standby!

127
00:13:33,016 --> 00:13:37,016
はい、よろしくお願いします。
Yes, we'll do our best.

128
00:13:37,016 --> 00:13:39,016
にゃあ、仲が良そうで、いいですね。
Wow, they seem to get along so well, it's nice.

129
00:13:39,016 --> 00:13:43,016
ま、ぶっちゃけあれは鷹嶺くんもまんざらでもなさそうだよね。
Well, honestly, it seems Takane-kun doesn't mind it either.

130
00:13:43,016 --> 00:13:47,016
そうですね。我々もパーティーに混ざっていいみたいですから。
That's true. It seems we're welcome to join the party too.

131
00:13:47,016 --> 00:13:51,016
なんかルイさんの作るポテトサラダが絶品らしいので。
Apparently, the potato salad made by Lui-san is exquisite.

132
00:13:51,016 --> 00:13:53,016
お、なんか詳しいね。
Oh, you seem well-informed.

133
00:13:53,016 --> 00:13:55,516
あ、まあまあまあまあ！
Ah, well, well, well, well!

134
00:13:55,516 --> 00:13:58,016
ということで、スタンバイができたみたいですね！
And with that, it seems they are ready!

135
00:13:58,016 --> 00:14:00,516
なんか、隠し事か？
Wait, is there a secret?

136
00:14:00,516 --> 00:14:02,516
あ、いいえいいえいいえ！
Ah, no, no, no!

137
00:14:02,516 --> 00:14:06,016
それでは参りましょう。ねこたかで、フィクサー！
Then let's begin. "Fixer" by Nekotaka!

138
00:14:40,016 --> 00:14:42,116
今日までの記憶の全部を
All the memories up until today,

139
00:14:42,116 --> 00:14:44,216
消してしまう時まで眠れない
I can't sleep until the moment they're all erased.

140
00:14:47,316 --> 00:14:49,416
あしたから生きていく自分の
I desperately want a substitute for myself

141
00:14:49,416 --> 00:14:51,516
身代わりが欲しくてたまらない
to go on living starting tomorrow.

142
00:14:54,016 --> 00:14:56,516
大丈夫と言わせて
Let me say "It's alright,"

143
00:14:56,516 --> 00:14:59,016
後から君のせいにさせてはくれないか
and won't you let me blame it on you later?

144
00:15:01,824 --> 00:15:06,024
今更意味ないから後から君のせいにさせてはくれないか
Since it's too late anyway, won't you let me blame it on you later?

145
00:15:06,224 --> 00:15:11,224
出来ない約束をとうとうと溢れる
Broken promises overflowing endlessly...

146
00:15:11,224 --> 00:15:15,124
一言一言ばかりに脳を奪われるくらい
To the point where my brain is overtaken by each and every word

147
00:15:15,124 --> 00:15:18,424
意味を成さない 何も出来ない
It makes no sense, I can do nothing

148
00:15:18,524 --> 00:15:21,324
見えない 逃げたい 飛びたい やめたい 逸らせない
I can't see, I want to run, I want to fly, I want to stop, I can't look away

149
00:15:21,824 --> 00:15:22,824
だから
So...

150
00:15:22,824 --> 00:15:25,124
沈め 沈め
Sink, sink...

151
00:15:25,124 --> 00:15:29,224
這い上がれないほどまで
To the point where you can't climb back up

152
00:15:29,224 --> 00:15:30,224
飽きるまで
Until you grow tired of it...

153
00:15:30,224 --> 00:15:32,424
落とせ 落とせ
Let it fall, let it fall...

154
00:15:32,424 --> 00:15:36,524
救い垂らす時まで
until a saving hand is extended

155
00:15:51,324 --> 00:15:55,724
嘘味の粒々を喉から締め出した悲鳴ごと噛み砕く
I crush the particles of lie-flavored taste, along with the screams choked out of my throat

156
00:15:58,224 --> 00:16:02,924
笑顔が下手なばっかで知ったような口振りに沿ってやり過ごす
Since I'm bad at smiling, I get by following familiar, knowing words

157
00:16:02,924 --> 00:16:05,424
なりたくなかった
I didn't want to become like this

158
00:16:05,424 --> 00:16:12,324
今日役立つ眠たい眠たい理想で救われることを待つ
Waiting to be saved by a sleepy, sleepy ideal that serves its purpose today

159
00:16:12,324 --> 00:16:15,524
一番目は「はい」の口で言う
The first thing I say is "Yes" with my mouth...

160
00:16:15,624 --> 00:16:19,424
力強く固く痛く噛み締めて
clenching my teeth strongly, firmly, and painfully

161
00:16:19,424 --> 00:16:21,824
死んでしまえ
Just die...

162
00:16:21,824 --> 00:16:22,424
しまえ
die!

163
00:16:22,424 --> 00:16:25,524
この先も過去も知らず
Without knowing the future or the past

164
00:16:25,524 --> 00:16:26,724
嫌いなら
If you hate it...

165
00:16:26,724 --> 00:16:29,124
壊せ 壊せ
destroy it, destroy it

166
00:16:29,124 --> 00:16:33,324
どうせなら加害者になればいい
You might as well become the perpetrator

167
00:16:33,324 --> 00:16:37,024
食べきれない苛立ちも
Both the frustration I can't swallow down...

168
00:16:37,024 --> 00:16:40,824
何も生まれない悲しみも
and the sorrow that births nothing...

169
00:16:40,824 --> 00:16:45,324
味気なくて吐き出す前にもう
It's tasteless, so before spitting it out...

170
00:16:45,324 --> 00:16:48,324
もう次を歌え
sing the next part already!

171
00:17:11,324 --> 00:17:14,524
沈め 沈め
Sink, sink...

172
00:17:18,024 --> 00:17:21,224
落とせ 落とせ
Let it fall, let it fall...

173
00:17:24,024 --> 00:17:27,524
どうせなら踊り踊れ
If you're going to do it, dance, dance!

174
00:17:27,524 --> 00:17:32,024
灰色になり切る前に打ち鳴らせ
Strike a beat before you turn completely gray

175
00:17:32,024 --> 00:17:34,524
変われ 変われ
Change, change

176
00:17:34,524 --> 00:17:38,524
眠り落ちる時まで
until the moment you fall asleep

177
00:17:38,524 --> 00:17:42,024
どうせなら奪え 奪え
If you're going to do it, snatch it away, snatch it away

178
00:17:42,024 --> 00:17:45,024
飼い慣らした嘘暴いて
expose the lies you've tamed

179
00:17:45,024 --> 00:17:49,024
煮え滾る頭に過ぎった虚像を
The phantom that crossed my boiling mind...

180
00:17:49,024 --> 00:17:52,524
見ていた
I was watching it

181
00:17:52,524 --> 00:17:57,024
自分を見ていた
I was looking at myself

182
00:18:17,024 --> 00:18:19,824
続いては、ルイなでのお二人です
Next up is the duo, RuiNade!

183
00:18:19,824 --> 00:18:22,524
よろしくお願いします
We look forward to working with you!

184
00:18:22,624 --> 00:18:24,324
元気がいいなぁ
They're so energetic!

185
00:18:24,324 --> 00:18:25,524
また言ってる、また
There you go saying that again.

186
00:18:25,524 --> 00:18:29,224
お二人は先輩と後輩なんだよね
You two are senior and junior, right?

187
00:18:29,224 --> 00:18:30,024
よく話すの？
Do you talk often?

188
00:18:30,024 --> 00:18:32,824
はい、よくご飯に行ったりしてます
Yes, we often go out to eat together.

189
00:18:32,824 --> 00:18:34,524
お、ご飯！いいな
Oh, meals! That's nice.

190
00:18:34,524 --> 00:18:35,724
何食べてるの？
What do you eat?

191
00:18:35,724 --> 00:18:39,024
主に、しゃぶしゃぶですかね
Mainly shabu-shabu, I think!

192
00:18:39,024 --> 00:18:40,024
しゃぶしゃぶか
Shabu-shabu, huh?

193
00:18:40,024 --> 00:18:43,124
一緒の鍋をつつく関係、これいいね
Sharing a hot pot together, that's a great relationship!

194
00:18:43,124 --> 00:18:44,224
はい！
Yes!

195
00:18:44,224 --> 00:18:48,024
実は、ポルさんに相談がありまして
Actually, I have a concern I want to consult Polka-san about...

196
00:18:48,024 --> 00:18:50,024
ポルさんに相談...？
Consultation with Polka-san...?

197
00:18:50,024 --> 00:18:56,524
ルイ先輩はいつまで経っても私の、お母さんになってくれないんですよ！
No matter how much time passes, Rui-senpai won't become my mom!

198
00:18:56,524 --> 00:18:58,224
ルイ先輩がお母さんになってくれない？
Rui-senpai won't become your mom?

199
00:18:58,224 --> 00:19:00,624
先輩をお母さんにする...？
Making your senior your mom...?

200
00:19:00,624 --> 00:19:08,024
私はいつだって優しいお母さんになってくださる方々を募集してます！よろしくお願いします！
I am always looking for people who will be a kind mom to me! Please apply!

201
00:19:08,024 --> 00:19:10,524
なんでお母さんになってあげないの、逆に？
Why don't you become her mom, then?

202
00:19:10,524 --> 00:19:17,024
いや、なんか、かなでは「娘」って感じがしないというか
Well, Kanade doesn't really feel like a "daughter" to me...

203
00:19:17,024 --> 00:19:22,824
娘になったら、手がかかりすぎて、ちょっと責任持てないなーって
If she became my daughter, she'd require way too much work, and I couldn't take that responsibility.

204
00:19:22,824 --> 00:19:24,224
親戚ポジションでいいかなって
So maybe an "aunt/relative" position is better.

205
00:19:24,224 --> 00:19:26,524
あ、結構壮大な
Oh, it's quite a grand scheme.

206
00:19:26,524 --> 00:19:29,824
音乃瀬君は、他にもママがいるの？
Otonose-kun, do you have other moms too?

207
00:19:29,824 --> 00:19:31,524
もちろん、もちろん！
Of course, of course!

208
00:19:31,524 --> 00:19:33,824
じゃあ要らないでしょ！何で欲しいの？
Then you don't need one! Why do you want another?

209
00:19:33,824 --> 00:19:39,024
頼れる人は一杯いた方がいいじゃないですか！逆にポルさん、お父さんになってくれませんか？
Isn't it better to have as many people to rely on as possible! Polka-san, won't you become my dad instead?

210
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:41,524
お父さん？
Dad?

211
00:19:41,524 --> 00:19:45,024
お父さん！？
Dad!?

212
00:19:45,024 --> 00:19:48,024
どうですか？
What do you think?

213
00:19:48,024 --> 00:19:52,524
いや、その意見は「お父さん（通さん）」ってな！
No, I can't "pass" on that opinion, dad!

214
00:19:55,524 --> 00:19:59,024
はい、え、というわけでね。ルイなでにはこのあと、「名前のない怪物」を披露していただきます！
Alright, well... next, RuiNade will perform "Namae no Nai Kaibutsu"!

215
00:20:00,032 --> 00:20:01,332
かなで：はい。/ ポルカ：なんでこの曲選んだの？
Kanade: Yes. / Polka: Why did you choose this song?

216
00:20:01,332 --> 00:20:04,232
ルイ：いや、それはすぐ、すぐいけるんだ、そうやって。
Lui: Well, we can get right into it like that.

217
00:20:04,232 --> 00:20:10,532
ルイ：え、私がですね、エゴイストが大好きなんで、その中でもこの曲がすごい大好きなんですけど、
Lui: I really love EGOIST, and among their songs, I especially love this one.

218
00:20:10,532 --> 00:20:17,032
ルイ：奏の初めての歌ってみたがこの曲で、いつか一緒に歌いたいなと思ってこの曲にしました。
Lui: Kanade's first cover song was this one, so I chose it because I wanted to sing it with her someday.

219
00:20:17,032 --> 00:20:19,432
かなで：嬉しい。
Kanade: I'm so happy.

220
00:20:19,432 --> 00:20:23,032
フブキ：それではですね、お二人ともスタンバイお願いします。
Fubuki: Now then, both of you, please get on standby.

221
00:20:23,032 --> 00:20:27,532
ルイ・かなで：はい、よろしくお願いします。
Lui & Kanade: Sure, we'll do our best.

222
00:20:27,532 --> 00:20:30,032
ポルカ：なんか、はちゃめちゃな子だね。
Polka: She's quite a wild kid, isn't she?

223
00:20:30,032 --> 00:20:34,532
フブキ：はい、ですね。なんかよく月曜日に現実を突きつけたりしてるみたいですよ。
Fubuki: Yes, indeed. Apparently, she often slaps people with reality on Mondays.

224
00:20:34,532 --> 00:20:36,532
ポルカ：ああ、罪深い。
Polka: Ah, how sinful.

225
00:20:36,532 --> 00:20:38,232
ポルカ：クソガキだ。/ フブキ：クソガキですね、はい。
Polka: She's a brat. / Fubuki: A brat indeed, yes.

226
00:20:38,232 --> 00:20:43,032
フブキ：ま、しかし歌で魅せてくれるので、ギャップ萌えしてる人も多いんじゃないかなと思います。
Fubuki: But since she captivates us with her singing, I think many people love the gap.

227
00:20:43,032 --> 00:20:47,032
ポルカ：鷹嶺くんも歌うとかっこいいのに、なんかポンコツだからね。
Polka: Lui-kun is also really cool when singing, but usually quite clumsy.

228
00:20:47,032 --> 00:20:51,032
フブキ：そうですね。ま、ギャップがあるお二人って感じじゃないでしょうかね。
Fubuki: Indeed. So they're a duo with great gaps, wouldn't you say?

229
00:20:51,032 --> 00:20:55,032
フブキ：はい、それでは参りましょう。ルイナデで「名前のない怪物」。
Fubuki: All right, let's begin. LuiNade with "Namae no Nai Kaibutsu".

230
00:21:28,132 --> 00:21:33,232
御伽話は
The fairy tales

231
00:21:33,432 --> 00:21:38,232
さっき死んだみたい
seem to have just died.

232
00:21:38,432 --> 00:21:43,232
煉瓦の病棟で
In the brick ward,

233
00:21:43,432 --> 00:21:49,032
うまく歌えなくて
I couldn't sing well.

234
00:21:49,132 --> 00:21:54,132
霧に煙る夜
On a night shrouded in fog,

235
00:21:54,232 --> 00:21:59,832
浮かべ赤い月
a red moon floats.

236
00:21:59,932 --> 00:22:04,932
ほらみて 私を
Look at me...

237
00:22:05,032 --> 00:22:11,132
目を逸らさないで
Don't look away.

238
00:22:11,232 --> 00:22:16,832
黒い鉄格子の中で 私は生まれてきたんだ
I was born inside black iron bars.

239
00:22:16,932 --> 00:22:22,032
悪意の代償を支払え 望むがままにお前に
Pay the price of malice, just as you desire.

240
00:22:22,132 --> 00:22:27,732
さあ 怯えよう正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Now, let's fear justice, destroying before being destroyed.

241
00:22:27,832 --> 00:22:30,432
因果の代償を払い
Paying the price of karma,

242
00:22:30,532 --> 00:22:38,032
共に行こう 名前のない怪物
let's go together, monster without a name.

243
00:22:48,532 --> 00:22:53,332
耳鳴りがしてる
My ears are ringing,

244
00:22:53,432 --> 00:22:58,432
鉄条網うるさくて
the barbed wire is so noisy.

245
00:22:58,532 --> 00:23:04,032
思い出せないの
I can't remember

246
00:23:04,132 --> 00:23:09,532
あの日の旋律
the melody of that day.

247
00:23:09,632 --> 00:23:14,632
雨はまだ止まない
The rain still hasn't stopped,

248
00:23:14,732 --> 00:23:19,932
何も見えないの
I can't see anything.

249
00:23:20,032 --> 00:23:25,032
ほらみて こんなに
Look, I have grown

250
00:23:25,132 --> 00:23:31,032
大きくなったの
so big now.

251
00:23:31,132 --> 00:23:36,532
黒い雨 降らせこの空 私は望まれないもの
Make black rain fall from this sky, I am unwanted.

252
00:23:36,632 --> 00:23:41,832
ひび割れたノイローゼ 愛す同罪の傍観者達に
A cracked neurosis to the beloved, equally guilty onlookers.

253
00:23:41,932 --> 00:23:44,732
さあ 今ふるえ正義を
Now, brandish your justice,

254
00:23:44,832 --> 00:23:47,332
消せない傷抱きしめて
embrace the unerasable wounds.

255
00:23:47,432 --> 00:23:49,932
この身体を受け入れ
Accepting this body,

256
00:23:50,032 --> 00:23:59,032
共に行こう 名前のない怪物
let's go together, monster without a name.

257
00:24:14,032 --> 00:24:16,832
ああ
Ah...

258
00:24:16,932 --> 00:24:26,532
神ハ告ゲル
God foretells...

259
00:24:26,632 --> 00:24:36,032
眞ノ世界ヲ
the true world.

260
00:24:57,032 --> 00:25:00,032
黒い鉄格子の中で
Inside the black iron bars...

261
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:02,140
私は生まれてきたんだ
I was born into this world,

262
00:25:02,140 --> 00:25:05,440
悪意の代償を願え
desiring the price of malice.

263
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:07,440
望むがままにお前に
Just as you wish, to you...

264
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:10,540
さあ 与えよう 正義を
Come, let me give you justice.

265
00:25:10,540 --> 00:25:13,240
壊して 壊される前に保存
Destroy it, before you are destroyed.

266
00:25:13,240 --> 00:25:15,540
因果の代償を払い
Pay the price of karma,

267
00:25:15,540 --> 00:25:18,540
報いよ 名もなき怪物
and receive your retribution, nameless monster!

268
00:25:18,540 --> 00:25:21,340
黒い雨 降らせこの空保存
Make the black rain fall from this sky.

269
00:25:21,340 --> 00:25:23,640
私は望まれないもの
I am an unwanted being.

270
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:26,140
ひび割れたノイローゼ
A cracked neurosis,

271
00:25:26,140 --> 00:25:29,040
愛す同罪の傍観者達に保存
to the beloved bystanders of equal guilt...

272
00:25:29,040 --> 00:25:31,740
さあ 今ふるえ 正義を
Come, brandish your justice now!

273
00:25:31,740 --> 00:25:34,340
消せない傷を抱きしめて
Embracing the wounds that can't be erased,

274
00:25:34,340 --> 00:25:36,740
この身体を受け入れ
accepting this body,

275
00:25:36,740 --> 00:25:44,540
共に行こう 名もない怪物
let's go together, nameless monster!

276
00:26:28,040 --> 00:26:34,040
さて、ここからは、楠木ともりが
鷹嶺ルイ生誕記念グッズをご紹介！
Now, from here on, Tomori Kusunoki will introduce
Takane Lui's Birthday Celebration Goods!

277
00:26:34,040 --> 00:26:40,040
ラメ入りアクリルスタンド！
キラキラなラメ入りアクリルスタンドがとってもおしゃれな一品。
First, the Glitter Acrylic Stand!
A glittering, glitter-filled acrylic stand that is incredibly stylish.

278
00:26:41,040 --> 00:26:45,040
光を浴びるたびに、きめ細かなラメが
キラキラと輝きを放ちます。
Each time it catches the light,
the fine glitter sparkles brilliantly.

279
00:26:46,040 --> 00:26:51,040
光り輝くアクリルスタンドで、
あなたの生活も更に明るくなるでしょう。
With this shining acrylic stand,
your daily life is sure to become even brighter.

280
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:57,040
ロック風パーカー！イベントやライブで着るだけでなく、
日常にも溶け込むロック風パーカー。
Next, the Rock-style Hoodie!
Not just for events and concerts, it blends perfectly into everyday life.

281
00:26:57,040 --> 00:27:04,040
前にジップがついているので、部屋着でも
普段着でも使いやすい！ヘビロテ間違いなし！
With a front zipper, it's easy to wear as loungewear
or casual clothing! A guaranteed daily favorite!

282
00:27:04,040 --> 00:27:10,040
ゆるかわバケットハット！
つくねとつみれがワンポイントになっていて、シンプルおしゃかわ。
The Cute Bucket Hat!
Featuring Tsukune and Tsumire as accents, it's simple yet stylishly cute.

283
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:14,040
普段使いしやすいデザインで、手軽におしゃれ度アップ！
With an easy-to-wear daily design,
it effortlessly upgrades your style!

284
00:27:14,040 --> 00:27:21,040
カジュアル、ストリート、古着MIX、
きれいめカジュアルのハズしアイテムなど、幅広いスタイルにマッチします。
It matches a wide range of styles, from casual, street,
thrift-mix, to a relaxed accent for smart-casual.

285
00:27:21,040 --> 00:27:27,040
「え？」Tシャツ！
ルイ姉でお馴染みのセリフ「え？」をモチーフにネタTとして堂々発売！
The "Huh?" T-Shirt!
Emblazoned with Lui-nee's signature catchphrase, "Huh?",
it's proudly released as a joke tee!

286
00:27:27,040 --> 00:27:36,040
どんなコーディネートにも合う白で、夏は単体で、
冬はパーカーと合わせてインナーとして、一年を通して使えます。
In versatile white, it can be worn on its own in summer,
or layered under a hoodie in winter all year round.

287
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:39,040
全部セットは数量限定もアリ！
The Full Set is also available in limited quantities!

288
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:45,040
鷹嶺ルイ直筆サイン
＆箔押し複製メッセージ入りポストカード特典！
Bonus: Hand-signed autograph by Takane Lui
& a foil-stamped printed message postcard!

289
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:49,040
hololive公式ECサイトへ急げ！
Hurry over to the official Hololive Online Shop!

290
00:27:49,040 --> 00:27:51,040
今だけ！
For a limited time only!

291
00:27:53,040 --> 00:27:55,140
続いてはミオルイです！保存
Next up is Mio-Lui!

292
00:27:55,140 --> 00:27:59,040
よろしくお願いします！
We look forward to working with you!

293
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:03,540
なかなかの、この二人っていうのは、
珍しいよね。
It's quite rare to see the two of you
paired up like this, isn't it?

294
00:28:03,540 --> 00:28:07,040
そう、ですかね？ / そう、ですかねー？うふふ。
Do you think so? / Really? Hehehe.

295
00:28:07,040 --> 00:28:11,240
結構、あの、お話はしたり、仲良いんですよ。 / はい、そうなんです。
Actually, we talk a lot and are quite close. / Yes, that's right.

296
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:15,540
うーん、何について話してる？
Hmm, what do you guys talk about?

297
00:28:15,540 --> 00:28:20,540
ええ、主に、まあ私がそもそもミオしゃの歌が
本当に大好きで、
Well, mainly... I absolutely love Mio-sha's singing
in the first place,

298
00:28:20,540 --> 00:28:24,540
よく歌のお話をしたりとか、 / 言ってくれてる。
so we talk about singing a lot. / She always says that.

299
00:28:24,540 --> 00:28:29,040
あとは個人的に私の悩みを聞いてもらったりとか
